# 01. Purpose

This document defines the intelligence architecture of AEGIS.

It establishes how AEGIS transforms heterogeneous operational information into:

```text
signals
→ observations
→ anomalies
→ investigations
→ evidence
→ assessments
→ recommendations
→ human decisions
→ outcomes
→ institutional learning
```

The objective is not to create an autonomous pathogen-response system.

The objective is to create a **high-trust decision-support system for experts operating in complex biological and healthcare environments.**

